### 约定总览
GET http://localhost:8024/api/validation/overview

### 创建成功
POST http://localhost:8024/api/validation/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice",
  "mobile": "13800138000",
  "status": "ENABLED",
  "address": {
    "province": "广东",
    "city": "深圳",
    "detail": "南山区"
  }
}

### 创建失败：多字段（手机号 + 枚举 + 用户名过短）
POST http://localhost:8024/api/validation/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "a",
  "mobile": "123",
  "status": "UNKNOWN",
  "address": {
    "province": "广东",
    "city": "深圳",
    "detail": "南山区"
  }
}

### 嵌套地址失败
POST http://localhost:8024/api/validation/users/nested-fail
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "bob",
  "mobile": "13900139000",
  "status": "ENABLED",
  "address": {
    "province": "广东",
    "city": "",
    "detail": "南山区"
  }
}

### 更新成功（路径 id 会写入 body 再按 Update 分组校验）
PUT http://localhost:8024/api/validation/users/1001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice2",
  "mobile": "13800138001",
  "status": "DISABLED",
  "address": {
    "province": "广东",
    "city": "广州",
    "detail": "天河区"
  }
}

### 方法级校验手机号
GET http://localhost:8024/api/validation/users/check-mobile?mobile=13800138000

### 方法级校验失败
GET http://localhost:8024/api/validation/users/check-mobile?mobile=abc

### 手动 Validator（模拟 MQ）
POST http://localhost:8024/api/validation/manual
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "mq-user",
  "mobile": "13700137000",
  "status": "ENABLED",
  "address": {
    "province": "广东",
    "city": "深圳",
    "detail": "福田"
  }
}
